sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Operator week5 script
    participant SS as SPIRE server
    participant SA as SPIRE agent
    participant AP as allowed workload pod
    participant DP as denied workload pod
    participant RP as relying workload endpoint
    OP->>SS: Check control plane health and list entries
    SS-->>OP: Return registration entries and trust bundle
    SS->>SA: Publish SVID material and bundle updates
    SA->>AP: Deliver SPIFFE SVID for allowed service account
    AP->>RP: Present workload identity over trust channel
    RP->>SS: Validate trust domain and registration lineage
    SS-->>RP: Confirm allowed identity
    RP-->>AP: Allow request
    DP->>RP: Attempt call without valid SPIRE entry
    RP->>SS: Resolve denied identity
    SS-->>RP: No matching SPIRE entry
    RP-->>DP: Deny unauthorized workload
